Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Test Plugins|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|test-event-portlet|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG
Scenario: View Event
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Test Event Page|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Event Consumer|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Event Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Event Producer|
	And Click at locator 'TestEventProducer#EVENT_PRODUCER_PORTLET_LINK'
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'PASSED' at locator 'TestEventConsumer#EVENT_CONSUMER_PORTLET_BODY'